.IX Title "AMSBENCHR 1"
.TH AMSBENCHR 1 2025-11-26 "perl v5.38.2" "AMS executables"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
amsbenchr \- Asynchronous Message Service (AMS) benchmarking meter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBamsbenchr\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBamsbenchr\fR is a test program that simply subscribes to subject "bench"
and receives messages published by \fBamsbenchs\fR until all messages in the
test \- as indicated by the count of remaining messages, in in the first
four bytes of each message \- have been received.  Then it stops receiving
messages, calculates and prints performance statistics, and terminates.
.PP
\&\fBamsbenchr\fR will register as an application module in the root unit of
the venture identified by application name "amsdemo" and authority name
"test".  A configuration server for the local continuum and a registrar
for the root unit of that venture (which may both be instantiated in a
single \fBamsd\fR daemon task) must be running in order for \fBamsbenchr\fR to
commence operations.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.IX Header "EXIT STATUS"
.IP \-1 4
.IX Item "-1"
\&\fBamsbenchr\fR failed, for reasons noted in the ion.log file.
.IP """0""" 4
.IX Item """0"""
\&\fBamsbenchr\fR terminated normally.
.SH FILES
.IX Header "FILES"
A MIB initialization file with the applicable default name (see \fBamsrc\fR\|(5))
must be present.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.IX Header "ENVIRONMENT"
No environment variables apply.
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
.IX Header "DIAGNOSTICS"
The following diagnostics may be issued to the \fBion.log\fR log file:
.IP "amsbenchr can't register." 4
.IX Item "amsbenchr can't register."
\&\fBamsbenchr\fR failed to register, for reasons noted in the ion.log file.
.IP "amsbenchr: subject 'bench' is unknown." 4
.IX Item "amsbenchr: subject 'bench' is unknown."
\&\fBamsbenchr\fR can't subscribe to test messages; probably an error in the MIB
initialization file.
.IP "amsbenchr can't subscribe." 4
.IX Item "amsbenchr can't subscribe."
\&\fBamsbenchr\fR failed to subscribe, for reasons noted in the ion.log file.
.IP "amsbenchr can't get event." 4
.IX Item "amsbenchr can't get event."
\&\fBamsbenchr\fR failed to receive a message, for reasons noted in the ion.log file.
.SH BUGS
.IX Header "BUGS"
Report bugs to <https://github.com/nasa\-jpl/ION\-DTN/issues>
